{"id":"daa83c79-80d7-4599-b08f-b37694510f00","expr":"(obj == null) == (result.toString().startsWith(\"null\")) || (obj != null)","rationale":"If obj is null, then result will have \"null\" appended at beginning, else no such guarantee.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(Object):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:24.873447916Z"}
{"id":"394e14b6-47c0-47ce-9afa-7fe1b190289d","expr":"result.size >= 0","rationale":"Size of the character array cannot be negative at any point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(Object):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:24.873447916Z"}
{"id":"aae56275-2c34-47de-bf22-ad303cbbae18","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"Given append adds characters, the resulting CharArray should not be empty after append.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(Object):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:24.873447916Z"}
{"id":"785598a5-b03c-4cbe-aec3-0d4c02822776","expr":"! (value == Long.MIN_VALUE) || result.contains('-')","rationale":"The method appends a full string with negative sign for Long.MIN_VALUE.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(long,int,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.241168303Z"}
{"id":"6da5a7f9-bafb-43be-a798-c3fdefb5af98","expr":"(! (value < 0L) || result.contains('-'))","rationale":"Negative values prepend a '-' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(long,int,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.241168303Z"}
{"id":"1f2967b1-e3e9-47ff-8161-432f8f204049","expr":"minLength <= result.size","rationale":"Padding is appended if minLength exceeds number of digits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(long,int,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.241168303Z"}
{"id":"d6e3d9da-d946-497d-9bdc-a301756d4eed","expr":"str == null || str.length() >= 0","rationale":"If str is not null, str.length() returns the length, which must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.653283716Z"}
{"id":"bf1af5d0-9e93-47c5-b657-39f0c46c151b","expr":"str == null || (str.length() == 0 || str.length() > 0)","rationale":"Ensures valid length semantics for string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.653283716Z"}
{"id":"75b97359-89b0-42b8-8d4b-0b3d3bfb547d","expr":"str == null || (str != null && str.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Null safe check of string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.653283716Z"}
{"id":"25190263-f92c-4625-89f0-dc0ec71966aa","expr":"str == null || str.chars().count() == str.length()","rationale":"If str is non-null, the number of characters counted matches its length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.653283716Z"}
{"id":"f9cc653a-8597-4832-9015-66df39ad3cb1","expr":"obj == null || obj.toString().length() >= 0","rationale":"Because the toString() method on Object should return a non-null string, thus its length is >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(Object):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:25.850902046Z"}
{"id":"66b36b4f-89f1-477b-8d58-d2eede12c058","expr":"str != null","rationale":"The method appends str, so it should be a valid String or null to handle.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String,String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:26.041454104Z"}
{"id":"51c2689e-9d61-4c3c-8981-fc93409b564f","expr":"separator != null","rationale":"The method appends separator only if size > 0, so it must be a safe String or null to handle.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String,String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:26.041454104Z"}
{"id":"0729c6d8-07f1-4680-a28e-80f9234d553c","expr":"str.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String,String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:26.041454104Z"}
{"id":"91922e85-2c6e-45cb-a64f-396522e313e8","expr":"separator.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String,String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:26.041454104Z"}
{"id":"e0551af4-f55b-46f4-8534-ba971d190c10","expr":"str == null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0 && start <= end && end <= str.length())","rationale":"If the string is non-null, the start and end indices define a valid range within the string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:29.715405587Z"}
