{"id":"b332a332-fdcb-4dd8-843c-45bf13a490c9","expr":"str == null || result.size >= 0","rationale":"The result CharArray size field is always greater or equal zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:30.609476224Z"}
{"id":"ce83c697-03d7-4412-bd24-24728e809d92","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || (str == null && result.size >= 0)","rationale":"If the passed StringBuffer is null, the result CharArray may have non-empty content due to appendNull.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:30.609476224Z"}
{"id":"9ec529e9-9925-4d27-9a89-07f1ba852772","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the instance itself, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:30.609476224Z"}
{"id":"da7a9d92-bcec-4c8a-8f52-77a5433fa2ea","expr":"str == null || (result.size >= str.length())","rationale":"When str is not null, the size of the CharArray has grown by at least the length of the input string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:30.882533067Z"}
{"id":"3e041034-e10f-4b7a-a04f-852c32d5f0f3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result object is never null as the method returns 'this'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(String):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:30.882533067Z"}
{"id":"163015ec-87a6-4d4e-a86c-1bcc650ea7bd","expr":"str == null || str.length() >= 0","rationale":"If str is not null, it is a StringBuilder with length at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.071265478Z"}
{"id":"a93579b6-e1f3-490d-9629-faa96b9ad309","expr":"str == null || str.toString().length() == str.length()","rationale":"StringBuilder.toString() returns a String of the same length as StringBuilder.length()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.071265478Z"}
{"id":"3db45bdd-d1e0-40dc-b6d6-11e01b8f262c","expr":"str == null || str.capacity() >= str.length()","rationale":"StringBuilder's capacity always accommodates its length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.071265478Z"}
{"id":"a7798d1c-5c50-4895-8adc-6426cec0710a","expr":"str == null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0 && start <= end && end <= str.length())","rationale":"If str is not null, the start and end indices must be within valid ranges for substring extraction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.479068205Z"}
{"id":"113761f1-5823-444b-bc3c-b6f6ceae9595","expr":"end - start >= 0","rationale":"Length of substring to append is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.479068205Z"}
{"id":"7273bbda-4f51-414d-9e1b-4c42bcc0c69b","expr":"start <= end","rationale":"Start index can't be greater than end index in substring operations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.479068205Z"}
{"id":"8a0e18c9-f2ba-4dec-b17d-7d4b45ab3463","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Start index is non-negative, to avoid IndexOutOfBoundsException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.479068205Z"}
