{"id":"c450e360-7f0d-4fd2-8aef-2bbd3f93b533","expr":"str == null || result.size >= 0","rationale":"CharArray size should always be non-negative; append does not shrink size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.950265773Z"}
{"id":"92c46020-0247-4eba-997f-d48c7a8b397e","expr":"str == null || result.size >= str.length()","rationale":"If str is not null, the CharArray size should reflect at least the length of str appended.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.950265773Z"}
{"id":"6203a7fe-f2a4-437b-98bc-adddafcb97ee","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns 'this', which can't be null, result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:34.950265773Z"}
{"id":"043a56e7-b527-4119-975a-0aae86673dff","expr":"!(str == null) || result != null","rationale":"If str is null, result must be non-null since appendNull returns a CharArray instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:35.120358643Z"}
{"id":"526ae1b2-a5c1-4479-95c5-6c4d998be8b8","expr":"str != null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0)","rationale":"If str is null, the method returns early, so start and end are still expected to be non-negative if evaluated. Otherwise, if str is non-null, all bounds must hold.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:35.369569789Z"}
