{"id":"79d4e3ba-b01a-4858-b881-f023f3ea2bc2","expr":"str == null || (end <= str.length())","rationale":"Ensures the end does not overflow beyond the available characters of str, preventing exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:35.369569789Z"}
{"id":"69364040-e1df-498f-8fde-c38d3926c032","expr":"str == null || (start <= end)","rationale":"Checks that substring range is valid to avoid invalid index exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:35.369569789Z"}
{"id":"49800456-491a-4d35-b311-991e4ac25232","expr":"str == null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0 && start <= end && end <= str.length())","rationale":"Ensures all index bounds are valid in case of non-null str to prevent exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(StringBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:35.369569789Z"}
{"id":"97d16187-2ebe-43eb-9779-05f9b39847bd","expr":"str == null || str.size >= 0","rationale":"The size field of CharArray is expected to be non-negative as it indicates the number of characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.158722682Z"}
{"id":"2d379281-6e60-43e6-bb45-8aa92ed8cb68","expr":"str == null || str.size <= str.items.length","rationale":"The size field should not exceed the length of the backing char array items.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.158722682Z"}
{"id":"740634d3-43a3-4642-8eee-05af96309041","expr":"str == null || str.items != null","rationale":"If str is not null, then its internal char array items should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.158722682Z"}
{"id":"0514039b-b4dd-4ac5-97fe-51667e7552a2","expr":"str == null || str.ordered == true || str.ordered == false","rationale":"The ordered field is a boolean indicating if the array is ordered or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.158722682Z"}
{"id":"b76db6e4-c068-4a89-aa41-d035a3a51448","expr":"iterable != null","rationale":"The method immediately calls iterable.iterator(), so iterable must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendAll(Iterable<?>):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.398062123Z"}
{"id":"a24be4ec-0c24-4f65-bd15-49b482148bf3","expr":"iterable.iterator() != null","rationale":"The code uses iterable.iterator(), so the iterator must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendAll(Iterable<?>):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:37.398062123Z"}
{"id":"4979c307-f594-42f4-92f4-668d410a9a09","expr":"str != null || result.toString().endsWith(\"null\")","rationale":"When 'str' is null, the result should end with \"null\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:39.413706118Z"}
{"id":"9e1b77fe-648f-4b88-87f3-2c9ca5d958ed","expr":"str == null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0)","rationale":"Ensures valid indices for substring extraction from a non-null CharArray.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:39.534375104Z"}
