{"id":"75c88966-561b-4c61-ab21-030cadc8ea6e","expr":"str == null || (end <= str.size)","rationale":"Ensures the end index is within the bounds of the CharArray size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharArray,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T12:15:39.534375104Z"}
