{"id":"158191a2-9f02-435e-96ae-114c231e0047","expr":"radians != 0","rationale":"The method bails out early if the rotation angle is zero (no rotation). At method entry, non-zero radians implies rotation will actually apply.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.math.Affine2#rotateRad(float):Affine2","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/math/Affine2.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:00:59.835084531Z"}
