{"id":"11f9dd09-d2cc-47a0-a3f2-ef2075fcd3d2","expr":"radius <= Math.max(Math.abs(x), Math.max(Math.abs(y), Math.abs(z))) * 10","rationale":"Radius should be in a reasonable range relative to the position, avoiding extremely large spheres.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.math.Frustum#sphereInFrustumWithoutNearFar(float,float,float,float):boolean","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/math/Frustum.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:13:52.345338818Z"}
